ctlsock: opt-in V9938 sprite-0 sensor for the SymbOS hardware cursor

Read the actual sprite attributes, scroll and bank layout; never write VRAM.
Unconfigured stations retain their existing cursor path.

--- a/src/osd/modules/ctlsock/ctlsock.cpp
+++ b/src/osd/modules/ctlsock/ctlsock.cpp
@@ -1176,7 +1176,19 @@
